{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d49e5ccb118113ec8a408bc452fdafab99a85c77706d8ca927495defa9e3bfd7","ja":"歌織の才能","zh":"歌织的才能","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"86530c6452b5cc2e5e662a0ffd50eb783053be5c23bd4c91e4dc2945476ac08c","ja":"そうして迎えた、アイドルオーディション当日。\n歌織たちは別室で様子を見ていて……","zh":"就这样迎来了偶像选拔会当天。\n歌织她们在另一间房里看着情况……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1a9c42acb0793ffa1d3c4641da8b3a164913325b5f63c5e88267dc7ac3a66f2b","ja":"「合格者はあとひとり……サツキさん、おめでとう！\n努力の成果を感じた。特に歌声が素晴らしかったわ」","zh":"合格者还剩最后一位……萨月，恭喜你！\n我感受到了你努力的成果，尤其是歌声非常出色。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f7fe0e53f634105b6e4365b8506f85e028b483eb863b7ec66cb88fe1aff4dc22","ja":"「あ、あ……ありがとうございます！\n私、精一杯頑張ります！」","zh":"「啊、啊……谢谢您！\n我会尽力的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"075d64de3d7b9cf552f82accb89a2cdcacee5ff0c055f9e6235460c04fb14378","ja":"や、やったわ！\nよかったわね、サツキちゃん！","zh":"成、成功了！\n太好了，萨月！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5bad1349a61c3fd69634bebadb105b35590ce44a9ad70edd689702f14de553a0","ja":"「みなさん！　本当にありがとうございました！\nみなさんのおかげで、合格できました！」","zh":"大家！真的非常感谢！\n多亏了大家，我合格了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"071b22930fda206c470bc1838705d6106fb1119f1f4c4fce7e9dd6b5bedc9809","ja":"おめでとう。これであなたも、\nアイドルの道に一歩踏み出せたわね。","zh":"恭喜你。这样一来，你也\n踏上偶像之路了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"df751dec303a702905745ab88ce146cdc4ab1a649f5660b815bc7189efede449","ja":"「はい！　それに私、新しい夢もできちゃいました！\nいつか桜守さんたちと同じステージに立ちたいです！」","zh":"「是的！而且我还拥有了新的梦想！\n总有一天，我想和樱守小姐她们站在同一个舞台上！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1cd59b20ca301a2d7e27ed0f51240942b4893a371fbdf1f18097f3283df9d5e1","ja":"わあ～！　とっても素敵だね！\nうん、絶対にステージで会おうね！","zh":"哇～！太棒了！\n嗯，绝对要在舞台上见面哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7c0064e6476f15b09442ece8a2b7b511ef4338754ae4ddd5f18e946baefd5c7b","ja":"ああ。本当に実現できるように、\nこれからも頑張りなよ！　応援してるからさ！","zh":"啊。为了让梦想真正实现，\n今后也要继续努力啊！我会为你加油的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8655d8b070f9b6e642d7171d62ab45b7df760289358d3adf4025fe4d92fc79f8","ja":"それと……これからも何かあったら相談してね。\n私で良かったら、助けになるから。","zh":"还有……如果以后有什么事，记得来找我商量哦。\n要是我能帮上忙的话，我会帮你的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"fc5f1f2c4526b94576c2e87c2c6560327e34a7d0c0438f309e0f8cfdd583b74f","ja":"「はい……よろしくお願いします！\n桜守プロデューサー！」","zh":"「好的……请多关照！\n樱守制作人！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d729eff07b44fe0f6feb9d607e8b4f2b39ac045f5518d4ae45724946a119083a","ja":"また改めて、合格のお祝いをする約束をし、\n歌織たちは帰路について……","zh":"她们约好改天再为通过考试庆祝，\n歌织一行踏上了回家的路……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"cb56349a6911311bcb8271902f7dd48400532c094495a992cb93acfa42c2cf16","ja":"それにしてもサツキの奴、\n短期間でずいぶん上達したよな。","zh":"话说回来，サツキ那家伙，\n短时间内进步真大啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"10a8b58cfff3d260890f6980a9021342c0c554d9e4202352667343e72dd48b29","ja":"もちろん、本人の頑張りの成果だけど……もしかして\nカオリ、プロデューサーの才能もあるんじゃないか？","zh":"当然是她自己努力的成果，不过……说不定\n歌织，你该不会也有制作人的才能吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"ed41f4db5519957a2deaf0d63bc6feb806f74055da7a58bb1fb4f99e9810bf77","ja":"そんなことないわ。ジュリアちゃんと\n麗花ちゃんがいてくれたおかげよ。","zh":"没那回事。都是多亏了茱莉亚和\n丽花在帮忙。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f8972ed6f50ee7cc7e6195ff6e6ee6be0498b0479a84501c7cd80f7f25c5787f","ja":"でも、私たちは歌織さんのプロデュースに合わせてた\nだけだから、やっぱり歌織さんがすごいんですよ！","zh":"但是，我们只是配合歌织的制作\n而已，所以歌织真的很厉害！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"6472fc6ed1f1174c644b152e7c8d4dffe715d88be26e3f6da7a4c961dc1f1055","ja":"ねえジュリアちゃん、私たちも歌織さんに\nプロデュースしてもらっちゃうっていうのはどうかな！","zh":"呐，茱莉亚，我们也请歌织小姐\n来负责我们的制作，怎么样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"87e684f159b2b83e59f51ba5037b2fd42894a8cb8ca688b69bfa038a49f56a6f","ja":"ははっ、いいね！　それじゃあ、\nこれからよろしくな、『桜守プロデューサー』♪","zh":"哈哈，好！那么，\n从今往后请多关照了，‘樱守制作人’♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"b1e85237f7ba4c7bcc58653c4803eef6f550ec88ecf72091ad7ffad6405126c7","ja":"もう、いくらなんでも無理よ。\nそれに……。","zh":"哎呀，无论如何也不行了。\n而且……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1824.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6f80ebe97dcdb958c091796f0a161a6fd0d3033cf12e5bd10a83890e9ff161a3","ja":"私たちは、私よりずっとすごい人に、\nプロデュースしてもらってるでしょ♪","zh":"我们可是一直由比我厉害得多的人\n负责制作的呀♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
